---
import { SITE, RECEPCION_FORM_URL, waLink } from '../data/site';

interface Props {
  isPage?: boolean;
}

const { isPage = false } = Astro.props;
const waDudas = waLink('Hola J-SAN, estoy llenando la planilla de recepción de mi vehículo y tengo una consulta:');
---

<section id="recepcion" class:list={['recepcion-section', isPage ? 'recepcion-page-mode' : 'section']}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <!-- CABECERA DEL SECTOR CON CONTEXTO INSTITUCIONAL -->
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="recepcion-badges-top">
        <span class="kicker kicker-gold">Protocolo Oficial de Ingreso</span>
        <span class="recepcion-live-badge">
          <span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Sistema Activo en Taller
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class:list={['sec-title', isPage && 'page-title']}>
        Recepción de Vehículo <em>en Taller</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="sec-lead">
        Registra el ingreso formal de tu vehículo a las instalaciones de <strong>{SITE.name}</strong> en Monte Cristo. Capturamos los datos del automóvil, kilometraje y síntomas reportados para iniciar de inmediato el escaneo computarizado y resguardo bajo techo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- TARJETAS DE CONTEXTO Y SEGURIDAD DEL CLIENTE -->
    <div class="context-grid">
      <div class="context-card">
        <div class="context-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.5 2.8C2.1 11 2 11.5 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2"/>
            <circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"/>
            <path d="M9 17h6"/>
            <circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="context-content">
          <h4>01. Ingreso Inmediato</h4>
          <p>Llena la planilla desde tu teléfono al llegar o antes de traer el carro para agilizar la entrada al portón sin papeleos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="context-card">
        <div class="context-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
            <path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="context-content">
          <h4>02. Reporte de Síntomas</h4>
          <p>Indica si el carro patina, golpea en cambios, tiene bote de aceite ATF o testigo encendido en el tablero.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="context-card">
        <div class="context-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="context-content">
          <h4>03. Custodia &amp; Garantía</h4>
          <p>Taller resguardado con fosa y rampas en Los Ruices. RIF institucional <strong>{SITE.rif}</strong> con presupuesto previo por escrito.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CONTENEDOR TIPO TERMINAL PARA EL IFRAME OPTIMIZADO -->
    <div class="iframe-container-card">
      <div class="iframe-header">
        <div class="iframe-header-left">
          <span class="window-dot red" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="window-dot yellow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="window-dot green" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="iframe-title-label">Planilla Digital de Recepción · Base J-SAN</span>
        </div>
        <div class="iframe-header-right">
          <a
            href={RECEPCION_FORM_URL}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="open-external-btn"
            title="Abrir formulario en pestaña completa"
          >
            <span>Pantalla completa</span>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/>
              <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="iframe-wrapper" id="iframe-wrapper">
        <div class="iframe-loading-indicator" id="iframe-loader" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="spinner"></div>
          <span>Cargando formulario seguro de recepción...</span>
        </div>

        <iframe
          src={RECEPCION_FORM_URL}
          class="recepcion-iframe"
          id="recepcion-lark-iframe"
          title="Formulario Oficial de Recepción de Vehículo - HIDROMÁTICOS J-SAN, C.A."
          loading="lazy"
          allow="camera; geolocation; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen"
          allowfullscreen
          sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-modals allow-downloads"
        ></iframe>
      </div>

      <div class="iframe-footer">
        <div class="footer-note">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/>
          </svg>
          <span>
            ¿Problemas al cargar el formulario en tu teléfono? Abre directamente en <a href={RECEPCION_FORM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lark Base Formulario ↗</a>
          </span>
        </div>
        <a href={waDudas} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="footer-wa-link">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2 22l5-1.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2Zm5.5 14.1c-.2.7-1.3 1.3-1.9 1.4-.5.1-1.1.1-1.8-.1-.4-.1-1-.3-1.7-.6-3-1.3-4.9-4.3-5.1-4.5-.1-.2-1.2-1.6-1.2-3s.8-2.1 1-2.4c.3-.3.6-.4.8-.4h.6c.2 0 .4 0 .6.5l.9 2.1c.1.2.1.4 0 .6l-.4.6-.5.5c-.1.2-.3.3-.1.6.2.3.8 1.3 1.7 2.1 1.2 1.1 2.2 1.4 2.5 1.5.3.1.5.1.7-.1l1-1.2c.2-.3.4-.2.7-.1l2 1c.3.1.5.2.6.4 0 .1 0 .6-.2 1.1Z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Asistencia por WhatsApp en recepción</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  function initRecepcionLoader() {
    const iframe = document.getElementById('recepcion-lark-iframe') as HTMLIFrameElement | null;
    const loader = document.getElementById('iframe-loader');

    if (iframe && loader) {
      const hideLoader = () => {
        loader.classList.add('is-hidden');
      };

      iframe.addEventListener('load', hideLoader);

      // Fallback de seguridad por si el evento load se retrasa en móviles
      setTimeout(() => {
        if (!loader.classList.contains('is-hidden')) {
          hideLoader();
        }
      }, 4000);
    }
  }

  // Inicializar en primera carga y en cada navegación de ClientRouter
  initRecepcionLoader();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initRecepcionLoader);
</script>

<style>
  .recepcion-section {
    background: var(--sky);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sky-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sky-line);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .recepcion-page-mode {
    padding: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    background: #ffffff;
    border-top: none;
  }

  .recepcion-badges-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .recepcion-live-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--blue-corporate);
    background: var(--blue-soft);
    padding: 0.22rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(45, 88, 147, 0.2);
  }

  .live-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #178a42;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(23, 138, 66, 0.7);
    animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse-dot {
    0% {
      transform: scale(0.95);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(23, 138, 66, 0.7);
    }
    70% {
      transform: scale(1);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(23, 138, 66, 0);
    }
    100% {
      transform: scale(0.95);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(23, 138, 66, 0);
    }
  }

  .sec-title em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--blue-corporate);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.8vw, 3.8rem);
  }

  /* GRID DE CONTEXTO */
  .context-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
  }

  .context-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--sky-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.35rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .context-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-hover);
    border-color: rgba(45, 88, 147, 0.3);
  }

  .context-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--blue-soft);
    color: var(--blue-corporate);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .context-icon svg {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  .context-content h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--navy);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .context-content p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .context-content strong {
    color: var(--navy);
  }

  /* CARD DEL IFRAME CON ESTILO TALLER TECNOLÓGICO */
  .iframe-container-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--sky-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 42, 87, 0.08), 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 42, 87, 0.04);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .iframe-header {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.2rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .iframe-header-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .window-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .window-dot.red { background: #ff5f56; }
  .window-dot.yellow { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .window-dot.green { background: #27c93f; }

  .iframe-title-label {
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #f0f4fc;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .open-external-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(233, 194, 92, 0.3);
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .open-external-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(233, 194, 92, 0.2);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }

  /* WRAPPER DEL IFRAME Y OPTIMIZACIÓN MÓVIL */
  .iframe-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 780px;
    background: #fbfcfe;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .iframe-loading-indicator {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    z-index: 2;
    transition: opacity 0.35s ease, visibility 0.35s ease;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .iframe-loading-indicator.is-hidden {
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .spinner {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border: 3px solid var(--sky-line);
    border-top-color: var(--blue-corporate);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes spin {
    to {
      transform: rotate(360deg);
    }
  }

  .recepcion-iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 820px;
    min-height: 780px;
    border: none;
    display: block;
    background: #ffffff;
    /* Optimización de scroll táctil en smartphones */
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    touch-action: pan-y;
  }

  /* PIE DEL IFRAME CON SOPORTE WHATSAPP Y ENLACES DIRECTOS */
  .iframe-footer {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sky-line);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.4rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
  }

  .footer-note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .footer-note a {
    color: var(--blue-corporate);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .footer-note a:hover {
    color: var(--blue-hover);
  }

  .footer-wa-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    color: #127536;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: rgba(23, 138, 66, 0.08);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 138, 66, 0.25);
    transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .footer-wa-link:hover {
    background: #178a42;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* RESPONSIVE MÓVIL Y TABLET */
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .context-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }

    .iframe-wrapper {
      min-height: 720px;
    }

    .recepcion-iframe {
      height: 740px;
      min-height: 720px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .recepcion-badges-top {
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .recepcion-live-badge {
      font-size: 0.66rem;
      padding: 0.18rem 0.5rem;
    }

    .context-card {
      padding: 1.1rem 1rem;
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }

    .context-icon {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .context-icon svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
    }

    .iframe-header {
      padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
    }

    .iframe-title-label {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    .open-external-btn {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
    }

    .iframe-wrapper {
      min-height: 680px;
    }

    .recepcion-iframe {
      height: 700px;
      min-height: 680px;
    }

    .iframe-footer {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    }

    .footer-wa-link {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
